WEBVTT

00:03.520 --> 00:04.520
Yu'er

00:04.600 --> 00:06.600
Come let the empress see you

00:20.500 --> 00:23.400
One Month Later

00:23.480 --> 00:24.880
How can this be?

00:25.320 --> 00:26.080
Right

00:26.200 --> 00:27.560
How can he not follow orders?

00:27.640 --> 00:28.920
Rashly attack

00:29.000 --> 00:31.440
But he did win the battle after all

00:31.520 --> 00:33.320
Your Majesty arrives

00:42.960 --> 00:45.160
Pay respects to Your Majesty

00:49.680 --> 00:51.000
Let's all speak

00:51.080 --> 00:52.480
What's the matter?

00:53.720 --> 00:54.800
Your Majesty

00:54.880 --> 00:55.840
I

00:55.920 --> 00:57.587
Wish to impeach Zhu Yuanzhi

00:58.920 --> 01:00.000
Not long ago

01:00.080 --> 01:01.400
Our Beishuo Army

01:01.480 --> 01:04.080
Engaged in close combat with Wuzhao's Shixin division

01:04.160 --> 01:06.080
The Ministry of War ordered General Zhu

01:06.160 --> 01:07.520
After repelling the enemy

01:07.600 --> 01:09.520
To withdraw and defend the base

01:09.600 --> 01:11.240
But General Zhu did not follow orders

01:11.320 --> 01:12.360
Privately advanced recklessly

01:12.440 --> 01:14.560
Actually pursued deep into Wuzhao territory

01:14.960 --> 01:17.480
Causing heavy losses to our troops

01:17.960 --> 01:19.920
And disrupted Your Majesty's approved battle plan

01:20.000 --> 01:21.360
Completely

01:22.200 --> 01:23.560
But no matter what

01:23.720 --> 01:25.760
General Zhu achieved a great victory this time

01:25.840 --> 01:26.960
The entire southern Pingzhou

01:27.040 --> 01:28.560
Was recovered by the Beishuo Army

01:28.680 --> 01:29.480
I think

01:29.600 --> 01:30.840
Not only should he not be punished

01:30.920 --> 01:32.280
But should be heavily rewarded

01:32.360 --> 01:34.720
To encourage the enterprising spirit of all

01:35.160 --> 01:36.200
I remember

01:36.280 --> 01:38.040
The court only gave General Zhu

01:38.120 --> 01:39.787
Supplies to repel the enemy

01:40.000 --> 01:42.000
The money for his campaign

01:42.200 --> 01:43.867
Where did it come from?

01:44.400 --> 01:45.520
This Zhu Yuanzhi

01:45.600 --> 01:47.320
Is almost declaring himself king

01:47.480 --> 01:48.880
He uses

01:50.480 --> 01:52.813
Your Majesty's land reform as a banner

01:53.200 --> 01:54.040
In Qingzhou

01:54.160 --> 01:55.520
Extensively seized land

01:55.600 --> 01:57.267
Directly distributed to the army

01:57.440 --> 01:58.440
But General Zhu

01:58.520 --> 02:00.920
Did successfully implement Your Majesty's new policies

02:01.120 --> 02:02.800
This is a great merit

02:04.520 --> 02:06.800
Forcibly seized from great families

02:07.120 --> 02:08.680
Privately divided court land

02:08.960 --> 02:09.480
This

02:09.600 --> 02:10.920
Is clearly

02:11.000 --> 02:12.400
Bandit behavior

02:14.040 --> 02:14.640
Alright, alright

02:14.720 --> 02:16.120
Stop arguing

02:16.200 --> 02:17.720
Let's put this matter aside for now

02:17.800 --> 02:19.200
Discuss another day

02:19.920 --> 02:21.320
Court dismissed

02:31.520 --> 02:32.920
This phoenix

02:33.000 --> 02:34.400
Has gotten fat recently

02:34.840 --> 02:36.000
It seems

02:36.080 --> 02:38.120
Fan Zhong's meals are quite good

02:41.120 --> 02:42.120
Let's talk

02:42.200 --> 02:43.600
About General Zhu's matter

02:44.720 --> 02:45.920
What do you think?

02:46.000 --> 02:48.200
Although General Zhu won a small victory

02:48.280 --> 02:50.160
He so flagrantly ignored court orders

02:50.360 --> 02:51.800
If something major happens in the future

02:51.880 --> 02:53.560
And General Zhu still acts willfully

02:53.640 --> 02:55.640
Cannot coordinate closely with the center

02:55.880 --> 02:57.880
This would be a catastrophic hole

02:59.440 --> 03:00.480
Your son believes

03:00.560 --> 03:02.227
We cannot have wishful thinking

03:02.440 --> 03:03.840
Should be punished

03:03.920 --> 03:04.840
A general in the field

03:04.920 --> 03:06.960
May not always follow the ruler's orders

03:07.040 --> 03:08.880
The battlefield changes in an instant

03:08.960 --> 03:10.680
If everything follows central orders

03:10.880 --> 03:12.000
Then how do we seize opportunities?

03:12.160 --> 03:12.920
Since ancient times

03:13.080 --> 03:15.747
Victory and defeat are decided in an instant

03:16.320 --> 03:17.520
Father

03:17.600 --> 03:18.760
Your son believes

03:18.840 --> 03:20.320
General Zhu's intentions are correct

03:20.400 --> 03:21.640
And he's brave and decisive

03:21.720 --> 03:22.560
Should be rewarded

03:22.640 --> 03:24.040
Xuan shall prosper

